//RS /// D-TEST1: which parameter types the property-test runner can synthesize inputs
//RS /// for. The generator (codegen) covers the scalar value types plus `[T]` and
//RS /// `T?` of a generatable element. Anything else (user structs/enums, `Map`,
//RS /// functions, trait objects) has no automatic generator yet, so reject it with a
//RS /// clear error rather than miscompile (I3 — checking lives in sema).
